# Route: guide 34 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to 53, 35
# quests, 4.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood, Blasted Lands, Swamp of Sorrows, Teldrassil, Silverpine
# Forest): Felpaw Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village -> Emerald
# Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village -> Felpaw Village -> Emerald Sanctuary ->
# Morlos'Aran -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Jadefire Glen -> Ruins of Constellas ->
# Jaedenar -> Shatter Scar Vale -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 4104 Salve via
# Mining; 4105 Salve via Gathering; 4106 Salve via Skinning; 4107 Salve via
# Disenchanting; 5883 Salve via Mining; 5884 Salve via Gathering; 5885 Salve
# via Skinning; 5886 Salve via Disenchanting; 6032 Sacred Cloth.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Nekrum's Medallion (2991), In Search of Thaelrid (1198),
# Twilight Falls (1199), Starving Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458).

